+    {
+      "type": "text",
+      "title": "With poder, deber and an infinitive",
+      "content": "*Se* goes before the first verb, and that verb agrees with the noun that follows: *Se puede ver el mar*, *Se pueden ver las montañas*. If there is no noun, the verb stays singular: *Se puede entrar*. You know *deber* from B1 Unit 4; it works in the same way."
